{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06077","headline":"赠东岳焦链师 · 王维","name":"赠东岳焦链师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生千岁余，五岳遍曾居。\n遥识齐侯鼎，新过王母庐。\n不能师孔墨，何事问长沮。\n玉管时来凤，铜盘即钓鱼。\n竦身空里语，明目夜中书。\n自有还丹术，时论太素初。\n频蒙露版诏，时降软轮车。\n山静泉逾响，松高枝转疎。\n搘颐问樵客，世上复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}